  "details": "When it comes to prefabs, there exist the following issues with the Allow Ownership Transfer setting:\n- Allow Ownership setting does not propagate from Prefab to Prefab-instance. If you have an object in a scene with no variations from its Prefab: Open up the Prefab and uncheck Allow Ownership Transfer. Then go back to scene view: the Allow Ownership box will still be checked.\n- Allow Ownership setting does not persist. If I have a prefab in a scene, and uncheck the Allow Ownership Transfer setting, the setting will be checked again when I close and re-open the project.",
